<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ACM Sathyabama | Student Chapter — Cinematic Experience</title>
<meta name="description" content="Sathyabama Institute ACM Student Chapter: an immersive cinematic journey through computing, innovation, leadership, and community.">

<!-- Fonts: High-Contrast Editorial Serif (Playfair Display) + Clean Technical Sans (Inter) + Monospace -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,900;1,400;1,600;1,700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!-- GSAP 3.12+ & ScrollTrigger -->
<script src="public/js/gsap.min.js"></script>
<script src="public/js/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
<script>
  if (typeof gsap === 'undefined') {
    document.write('<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"><\/script>');
    document.write('<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/ScrollTrigger.min.js"><\/script>');
  }
</script>

<style>
/* ==========================================================================
   PART 1: DESIGN SYSTEM, PALETTE & EDITORIAL TYPOGRAPHY
   ========================================================================== */
:root {
  --bg: #050608;
  --bg-deep: #020305;
  --bg-panel: rgba(13, 16, 22, 0.78);
  --bg-panel-solid: #0c0f14;
  --fg: #f4f5f8;
  --fg-mut: #9ca3af;
  --fg-dim: #64748b;
  
  --pri: #ff2a3b;
  --pri-glow: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.6);
  --pri-subtle: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.15);
  --pri-dark: #800000;
  --accent-gold: #e5b869;
  
  --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  --line-light: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
  --line-red: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.45);
  
  --disp: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
  --sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  --mono: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
}

*, *::before, *::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  overflow-x: clip !important;
  overflow-y: visible !important;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow-x: clip !important;
  overflow-y: visible !important;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--fg);
  font-family: var(--sans);
}

::selection {
  background: var(--pri);
  color: #fff;
}

/* Background Particle Canvas */
#siteNetworkCanvas {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}

/* Base Typography */
h1, h2, h3, h4 {
  font-family: var(--disp);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.08;
  margin: 0;
}

p {
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  margin: 0;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   NAVIGATION HEADER
   ========================================================================== */
.site-header {
  position: fixed;
  top: 18px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  width: calc(100% - 48px);
  max-width: 1360px;
  height: 64px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(8, 10, 15, 0.72);
  backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 0 28px;
  z-index: 1000;
  transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.site-header.scrolled {
  top: 10px;
  background: rgba(6, 7, 10, 0.92);
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.28);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 24px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.15);
}

.brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
}

.brand-emblem-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #ff4b5c, #99000e 70%, #4a0007);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--pri-glow);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.brand-emblem-icon img {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.brand-text {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.brand-title {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #fff;
}

.brand-sub {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--fg-dim);
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 32px;
}

.nav-link {
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  position: relative;
  transition: color 0.25s ease;
  padding: 6px 0;
}

.nav-link:hover {
  color: #fff;
}

.nav-link::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 0;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pri-glow);
  transition: width 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.nav-link:hover::after {
  width: 100%;
}

.nav-cta {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff2a3b 0%, #ba0018 100%);
  color: #fff;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 10px 22px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 18px var(--pri-subtle);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.nav-cta:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 6px 26px var(--pri-glow);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  color: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 8px;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 2: HERO SECTION WITH 3D DUAL-COIN ROTATING MEDALLION
   ========================================================================== */
.hero-track {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 190vh;
  z-index: 2;
  background: #050608;
}

.hero-sticky {
  position: -webkit-sticky !important;
  position: sticky !important;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh;
  height: 100svh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .hero-sticky {
    align-items: flex-start !important;
    padding-top: 86px !important;
    overflow-y: auto !important;
  }
}

.hero-cinematic-bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero-bg-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  opacity: 0.18;
  filter: saturate(1.2) contrast(1.1);
}

.hero-bg-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, rgba(255,42,59,0.14) 0%, rgba(5,6,8,0.7) 50%, #050608 100%);
}

.hero-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1420px;
  padding: 40px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 40px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 3;
}

.hero-eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.hero-eyebrow::before {
  content: '';
  width: 28px;
  height: 1.5px;
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pri-glow);
}

.hero-headline {
  font-size: clamp(48px, 6.2vw, 86px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 0.98;
  letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 30%, #e2e8f0 75%, #94a3b8 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}

.hero-subhead {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 13.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.hero-subhead span {
  color: var(--pri);
  text-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--pri-glow);
}

.hero-desc {
  font-size: clamp(15px, 1.25vw, 17.5px);
  max-width: 540px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  margin-bottom: 34px;
}

.hero-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.btn-primary {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff2a3b 0%, #c4001a 100%);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 15px 32px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px var(--pri-subtle);
  transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 36px var(--pri-glow);
}

.btn-secondary {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 15px 30px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.btn-secondary:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.hero-meta-strip {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 28px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-dim);
}

.hero-meta-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.hero-meta-dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pri-glow);
}

/* 3D Tandem Medallions Stage */
.hero-stage-visual {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  perspective: 1200px;
}

.hero-glow {
  position: absolute;
  width: 130%;
  height: 130%;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.25) 0%, rgba(120, 0, 15, 0.1) 45%, transparent 70%);
  filter: blur(55px);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
}

.hero-particles-canvas {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -10%;
  width: 120%;
  height: 120%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
}

.tandem-medallions-3d {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  will-change: transform;
  z-index: 3;
}

/* 3D Laser Ribbon Wraps */
.laser-ribbon-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  width: 130%;
  height: 130%;
  pointer-events: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.laser-ribbon-bg {
  z-index: 2;
  transform: translateZ(-70px);
}

.laser-ribbon-fg {
  z-index: 7;
  transform: translateZ(70px);
}

.laser-svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  overflow: visible;
}

/* Medallion Coins */
.medallion-coin {
  position: absolute;
  width: clamp(260px, 26vw, 360px);
  height: clamp(260px, 26vw, 360px);
  border-radius: 50%;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
  backface-visibility: hidden;
}

.coin-front {
  z-index: 5;
  transform: translateX(-95px) translateY(4px) translateZ(55px) rotateY(-26deg) rotateX(4deg);
}

.coin-back {
  z-index: 3;
  transform: translateX(95px) translateY(-6px) translateZ(-55px) rotateY(22deg) rotateX(2deg) scale(0.94);
}

.coin-rim {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.coin-rim-base {
  inset: -6px;
  border: 4px solid #140407;
  box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.45), 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
  transform: translateZ(-8px);
}

.coin-rim-mid {
  inset: -4px;
  border: 3.5px solid rgba(225, 29, 46, 0.75);
  background: conic-gradient(from 135deg, #ff4d5a 0deg, #990f1d 90deg, #330408 180deg, #c41829 270deg, #ff4d5a 360deg);
  -webkit-mask: radial-gradient(farthest-side, transparent calc(100% - 4px), #fff calc(100% - 3px));
  mask: radial-gradient(farthest-side, transparent calc(100% - 4px), #fff calc(100% - 3px));
  transform: translateZ(0px);
}

.coin-rim-top {
  inset: -2px;
  border: 3px solid rgba(255, 80, 95, 0.85);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.65);
  transform: translateZ(8px);
}

.coin-neon-ring {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid #ff2a3b;
  box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.85), inset 0 0 16px rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.65);
  pointer-events: none;
  transform: translateZ(9px);
}

.coin-face {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #06070a;
  transform: translateZ(10px);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.coin-face-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}

.coin-glass-sheen {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04) 40%, transparent 60%);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 2;
}

.apex-lens-flare {
  position: absolute;
  width: 90px;
  height: 90px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #ffffff 0%, rgba(255, 240, 240, 0.95) 20%, rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.85) 45%, rgba(255, 42, 62, 0) 70%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 50px #ff2a3b, 0 0 100px #ff2a3b;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: scale(0.4);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 8;
}

.hero-scroll-prompt {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 30px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-dim);
  z-index: 10;
}

.mouse-pill {
  width: 20px;
  height: 34px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  padding-top: 6px;
}

.mouse-wheel {
  width: 3px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--pri-glow);
  animation: mouseWheelMove 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes mouseWheelMove {
  0% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
  60% { transform: translateY(12px); opacity: 0; }
  100% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 3: ABOUT SECTION (Driven by curiosity)
   ========================================================================== */
.section-about {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 140px 0 100px;
  background: var(--bg);
  z-index: 4;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.about-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  padding: 0 44px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.about-grid-3col {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1.1fr 1.05fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 50px;
  margin-bottom: 90px;
}

.about-col-left {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.section-tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.section-tag::before {
  content: '';
  width: 24px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--pri-glow);
}

.editorial-headline {
  font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 62px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.08;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.editorial-headline em {
  font-family: var(--disp);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--pri);
  text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.4);
}

.about-cta-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #fff;
  margin-top: 14px;
  transition: color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
}

.about-cta-link:hover {
  color: var(--pri);
  transform: translateX(4px);
}

.about-col-center {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.about-monolith-card {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 480px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(20, 24, 34, 0.6) 0%, rgba(8, 10, 15, 0.95) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
}

.about-monolith-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
  object-fit: cover;
  filter: contrast(1.1) brightness(0.96);
  transition: transform 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.about-monolith-card:hover .about-monolith-img {
  transform: scale(1.03);
}

.about-col-right {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.about-history-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  color: var(--pri);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.about-history-tag::before {
  content: '';
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--pri-glow);
}

.about-narrative {
  font-size: 15.5px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.about-narrative strong {
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.about-stat-strip {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  padding: 30px 38px;
  background: rgba(13, 16, 22, 0.65);
  border-radius: 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.about-stat-item {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
}

.about-stat-label {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-dim);
}

.about-stat-value {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 13.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  color: #fff;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 4: MISSION SECTION (A future shaped by innovation)
   ========================================================================== */
.section-mission {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 120px 0 100px;
  background: var(--bg-deep);
  z-index: 5;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.mission-parallax-backdrop {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: -5%;
  width: 55%;
  height: 100%;
  opacity: 0.35;
  pointer-events: none;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.18) 0%, transparent 65%);
}

.mission-backdrop-img {
  position: absolute;
  top: 15%;
  right: 5%;
  width: 520px;
  max-width: 48vw;
  border-radius: 18px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
  opacity: 0.85;
}

.mission-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  padding: 0 44px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.mission-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
  gap: 60px;
}

.mission-headline {
  font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 62px);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.08;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.mission-headline em {
  font-family: var(--disp);
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: var(--pri);
  text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.4);
}

.mission-lead-p {
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  margin-bottom: 40px;
  max-width: 620px;
}

.mission-objectives-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.mission-objective-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  padding: 18px 24px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: rgba(14, 18, 25, 0.72);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

.mission-objective-row:hover {
  background: rgba(20, 26, 36, 0.85);
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.35);
  transform: translateX(6px);
}

.mission-icon-circle {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #ff2a3b, #73000d);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--pri-glow);
}

.mission-row-text {
  font-size: 14.5px;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.mission-row-text strong {
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 5: LEADERSHIP — STUDENT OFFICERS & CINEMATIC SHOWCASE CSS
   ========================================================================== */
.section-leadership {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 120px 0 80px;
  background: var(--bg);
  z-index: 6;
}

.leadership-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  padding: 0 44px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.faculty-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  margin: 32px 0 60px;
}

.faculty-card {
  padding: 24px 28px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: rgba(14, 18, 25, 0.7);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.faculty-card:hover {
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.4);
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 20px rgba(255,42,59,0.15);
}

.faculty-role-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
}

.faculty-name {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
}

.faculty-dept {
  font-size: 12.5px;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

/* 17-Member Cinematic Showcase Track */
.team-cinema-track {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: calc(17 * 80vh);
  margin: 40px 0 70px;
}

.team-cinema-sticky {
  position: -webkit-sticky !important;
  position: sticky !important;
  top: 80px;
  width: 100%;
  height: calc(100vh - 100px);
  min-height: 560px;
  max-height: 840px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 30%, #151a26 0%, #0d1017 65%, #080a0e 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  border-radius: 28px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), 0 0 50px rgba(225, 29, 46, 0.15);
  z-index: 20;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 24px 32px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
}

.cinema-bar {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  z-index: 10;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  padding-bottom: 16px;
}

.cinema-meta-tag {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

.cinema-live-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #ff2a3b;
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff2a3b;
  animation: pulseBeacon 2s infinite ease-in-out;
}

@keyframes pulseBeacon {
  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
  50% { transform: scale(1.4); opacity: 0.6; }
}

.cinema-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 14px;
}

.cinema-metric-pill {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.cinema-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 8px 18px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.cinema-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.4);
}

.cinema-btn.primary {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.85), rgba(180, 15, 30, 0.95));
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.35);
}

.cinema-stage {
  position: relative;
  flex: 1;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 40px;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 14px 0;
  z-index: 5;
}

.cinema-info-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 14px;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  z-index: 5;
}

.cinema-committee-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  width: fit-content;
  padding: 5px 14px;
  background: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.3);
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #ff4757;
}

.cinema-member-name {
  font-family: var(--disp);
  font-size: clamp(34px, 3.8vw, 52px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ffffff;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.cinema-member-role {
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 21px);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin: 0;
}

.cinema-member-sub {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

.cinema-member-desc {
  font-size: 14.5px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  max-width: 480px;
}

.cinema-screen-wrap {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 440px;
  aspect-ratio: 0.85;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.cinema-screen {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: #000;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 35px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.25);
}

.cinema-ambient-canvas {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -15%;
  width: 130%;
  height: 130%;
  filter: blur(40px);
  opacity: 0.45;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.cinema-fallback-img {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center top;
}

.cinema-video-fallback {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: none;
}

.cinema-canvas {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  z-index: 2;
}

.cinema-screen-rim {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 4;
}

.cinema-rail-wrap {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16px;
  z-index: 10;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  padding-top: 16px;
}

.cinema-rail-dots {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.cinema-dot {
  width: 9px;
  height: 9px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.25s ease;
}

.cinema-dot:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  transform: scale(1.2);
}

.cinema-dot.active {
  background: var(--pri);
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--pri-glow);
  transform: scale(1.4);
}

.cinema-rail-nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.cinema-arrow-btn {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.cinema-arrow-btn:hover {
  background: var(--pri);
  border-color: var(--pri);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 6: ACTIVITIES & GALLERY CSS
   ========================================================================== */
.section-activities {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 120px 0 100px;
  background: var(--bg);
  z-index: 7;
}

.activities-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  padding: 0 44px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.activities-featured-card {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 24px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(18, 22, 31, 0.8) 0%, rgba(9, 12, 17, 0.95) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.feat-img-wrap {
  width: 100%;
  height: 380px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.feat-img-wrap img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  filter: contrast(1.05);
}

.feat-content {
  padding: 40px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.feat-meta {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.feat-title {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 42px);
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.feat-desc {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  margin-bottom: 26px;
}

.activities-grid-3col {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 28px;
}

.activity-story-card {
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: rgba(14, 18, 26, 0.75);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: all 0.35s ease;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.activity-story-card:hover {
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.45);
  transform: translateY(-6px);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 25px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.2);
}

.story-thumb {
  width: 100%;
  height: 200px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.story-thumb img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  transition: transform 0.6s ease;
}

.activity-story-card:hover .story-thumb img {
  transform: scale(1.06);
}

.story-info {
  padding: 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex: 1;
}

.story-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.story-title {
  font-size: 20px;
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.story-excerpt {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  margin-bottom: 18px;
  flex: 1;
}

/* Gallery Section */
.section-gallery {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 120px 0 100px;
  background: var(--bg-deep);
  z-index: 8;
}

.gallery-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  padding: 0 44px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.gallery-grid-canvas {
  width: 100%;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 22px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.gallery-photo-card {
  position: relative;
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  background: #000;
  height: 380px;
}

.gallery-photo-card.featured {
  height: 420px;
}

.gallery-photo-card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}

.gallery-photo-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 50%, rgba(5,6,8,0.92) 100%);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  padding: 24px;
}

.gallery-caption-title {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.gallery-caption-meta {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--pri);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 7: 3D LAPTOP (CRT EFFECT) & FIVE TEAMS SECTION CSS
   ========================================================================== */
.teams-track {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 300vh;
  z-index: 9;
}

.teams-sticky {
  position: -webkit-sticky !important;
  position: sticky !important;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 65%, #0f121a 0%, #06070a 65%, #010204 100%);
  padding: 40px 20px 20px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.teams-stage-title-wrap {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  z-index: 10;
}

.teams-stage-title-wrap h2 {
  font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 50px);
  color: #fff;
}

.teams-stage-title-wrap p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

.teams-cinema-viewport {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1380px;
  height: 540px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  perspective: 1100px;
}

/* Five Materialized Floating Team Panels Arc */
.team-panels-arc {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 0 10px;
  z-index: 12;
}

.team-card-3d {
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: rgba(14, 18, 25, 0.92);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  padding: 18px 14px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(50px) scale(0.85);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.team-card-3d:hover {
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.65);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 55px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 25px var(--pri-glow);
  transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.02);
}

.team-icon-bubble {
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #ff2a3b, #73000d);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--pri-glow);
}

.team-name {
  font-size: 15.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.team-tagline {
  font-family: var(--disp);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 12.5px;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.team-desc {
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

/* Light Rays SVG Overlay */
.laptop-rays-svg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 6;
}

.light-ray-path {
  fill: none;
  stroke: url(#rayGrad);
  stroke-width: 2.5;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px #ff2a3b) drop-shadow(0 0 24px #ff1744);
  stroke-dasharray: 600;
  stroke-dashoffset: 600;
}

/* Realistic 3D Laptop with CRT Screen */
.laptop-stage {
  position: relative;
  width: 440px;
  height: 320px;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  transform: rotateX(12deg) rotateY(0deg);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 8;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.laptop-hinge {
  position: absolute;
  top: 195px;
  left: 10px;
  width: 420px;
  height: 10px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3a4252 0%, #171b24 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  z-index: 5;
}

.laptop-lid {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 125px;
  left: 10px;
  width: 420px;
  height: 205px;
  border-radius: 12px 12px 2px 2px;
  background: #0d0f14;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  transform-origin: bottom center;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
  /* Begins closed flat against the base (75deg), opens upright to -10deg */
  transform: rotateX(75deg);
  box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 4;
}

.laptop-screen {
  width: calc(100% - 16px);
  height: calc(100% - 16px);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #200408 0%, #08090d 80%, #030406 100%);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.5);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 45px rgba(255,42,59,0.4);
}

/* CRT Scanline & Phosphor Grid Overlay */
.crt-overlay {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55) 50%),
              linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.08), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.03), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.08));
  background-size: 100% 3px, 6px 100%;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 5;
}

.screen-core-light {
  position: absolute;
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #ff2a3b 0%, #ff1744 40%, rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.2) 75%, transparent 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 60px #ff2a3b, 0 0 100px #ff1744;
  opacity: 0.1;
}

.screen-glow-emblem {
  width: 60px;
  height: 60px;
  object-fit: contain;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px #ff2a3b) drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(255,42,59,0.6));
  z-index: 2;
  opacity: 0.2;
}

.screen-terminal-text {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #ff4d5a;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  margin-top: 8px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ff2a3b;
  z-index: 2;
  opacity: 0;
}

.laptop-base {
  position: absolute;
  top: 195px;
  left: 10px;
  width: 420px;
  height: 190px;
  border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1d2129 0%, #111318 60%, #090a0d 100%);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-top: none;
  transform-origin: top center;
  transform: rotateX(75deg);
  box-shadow: 0 35px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.95), 0 0 35px rgba(255,42,59,0.25);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.keyboard-deck {
  width: 360px;
  height: 100px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: #06070a;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 3px;
  padding: 5px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.key-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 3px;
}

.key {
  flex: 1;
  background: #151821;
  border-radius: 2px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
  box-shadow: 0 0 2px rgba(255,42,59,0.2);
}

.trackpad {
  width: 120px;
  height: 55px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.teams-footer-action {
  margin-top: 12px;
  z-index: 10;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(15px);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   PART 8: FINAL SECTION — CONVERGENCE & OFFICIAL FOOTER CSS
   ========================================================================== */
.section-connect {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 120px 0 80px;
  background: var(--bg-deep);
  z-index: 10;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.connect-container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1440px;
  padding: 0 44px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.convergence-emblem-wrap {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 70px;
}

.convergence-emblem-icon {
  width: 110px;
  height: 110px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #ff4b5c, #99000e 70%, #3d0006);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  box-shadow: 0 0 60px var(--pri-glow), 0 0 100px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.35);
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.convergence-emblem-icon img {
  width: 70px;
  height: 70px;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.convergence-title {
  font-size: clamp(42px, 5.6vw, 78px);
  color: #fff;
  line-height: 1.02;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.convergence-sub {
  font-size: clamp(16px, 1.35vw, 19px);
  max-width: 640px;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 36px;
}

.convergence-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
}

.connect-social-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
  margin: 70px 0 60px;
}

.social-card {
  padding: 24px 20px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: rgba(14, 18, 25, 0.7);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  gap: 12px;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.social-card:hover {
  background: rgba(22, 28, 38, 0.85);
  border-color: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.45);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 20px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.2);
}

.social-icon-box {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.3);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: var(--pri);
  font-size: 18px;
}

.social-name {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
}

.social-handle {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--fg-dim);
}

.official-footer-card {
  padding: 40px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: rgba(10, 13, 18, 0.8);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.9fr 0.9fr;
  gap: 36px;
}

.footer-col-title {
  font-family: var(--sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.footer-col-desc {
  font-size: 13.5px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

.site-bottom-bar {
  margin-top: 50px;
  padding-top: 28px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--fg-dim);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
}

/* Modal */
.story-modal {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 30px;
  z-index: 2000;
}

.modal-dialog {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 820px;
  max-height: 90vh;
  border-radius: 24px;
  background: #0d1016;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  box-shadow: 0 35px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95), 0 0 40px rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.25);
  overflow-y: auto;
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.modal-close-btn {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20px;
  right: 20px;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  z-index: 5;
  transition: all 0.25s ease;
}

.modal-close-btn:hover {
  background: var(--pri);
  transform: rotate(90deg);
}

.modal-img-stage {
  width: 100%;
  height: 320px;
  position: relative;
}

.modal-body-content {
  padding: 36px 40px 40px;
}

.modal-meta-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--pri);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.modal-title {
  font-size: clamp(24px, 2.8vw, 36px);
  color: #fff;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.modal-narrative {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--fg-mut);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   RESPONSIVE DESIGN BREAKPOINTS
   ========================================================================== */
/* Mobile Nav Drawer */
.mobile-nav-drawer {
  position: fixed;
  top: 92px;
  left: 16px;
  right: 16px;
  background: rgba(10, 12, 18, 0.96);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-light);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
  z-index: 999;
  backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transform: translateY(-12px);
  transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 30px rgba(255,42,59,0.15);
}

.mobile-nav-drawer.open {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.mobile-nav-link {
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}

.mobile-nav-link:hover, .mobile-nav-link:active {
  background: rgba(255, 42, 59, 0.15);
  color: var(--pri);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .site-header { width: calc(100% - 32px); padding: 0 20px; }
  .nav-links, .nav-cta { display: none; }
  .menu-toggle { display: block; }
  .hero-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; text-align: center; padding: 110px 20px 30px !important; }
  .hero-eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .hero-headline { font-size: clamp(38px, 9vw, 56px); }
  .hero-desc { margin: 0 auto 24px; font-size: 14.5px; }
  .hero-actions { justify-content: center; }
  .hero-meta-strip { justify-content: center; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .about-grid-3col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  .mission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  .mission-parallax-backdrop { display: none; }
  .faculty-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cinema-stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .activities-featured-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .feat-img-wrap { height: 240px; }
  .activities-grid-3col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .gallery-grid-canvas { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .gallery-photo-card.side { display: none; }
  .teams-sticky { padding-top: 80px !important; justify-content: center !important; }
  .teams-stage-title-wrap { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .teams-cinema-viewport { height: 500px; }
  .team-panels-arc { 
    display: flex; 
    overflow-x: auto; 
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; 
    gap: 12px; 
    padding: 10px 16px; 
    width: 100%;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }
  .team-card-3d { 
    flex: 0 0 230px; 
    scroll-snap-align: center;
    padding: 16px 12px;
  }
  .laptop-stage { width: 320px; height: 240px; transform: scale(0.85); }
  .connect-social-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .official-footer-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .about-stat-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .connect-social-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Background Depth Particle Canvas -->
<canvas id="siteNetworkCanvas"></canvas>

<!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
<header class="site-header" id="siteHeader">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="brand-emblem-icon">
      <img src="public/acm_3d_cube_emblem.png" alt="ACM Logo">
    </div>
    <div class="brand-text">
      <span class="brand-title">ACM Sathyabama</span>
      <span class="brand-sub">Student Chapter · Est. 2021</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <nav class="nav-links" id="mainNav">
    <a href="#about" class="nav-link">About</a>
    <a href="#mission" class="nav-link">Mission</a>
    <a href="#leadership" class="nav-link">Leadership</a>
    <a href="#activities" class="nav-link">Activities</a>
    <a href="#gallery" class="nav-link">Gallery</a>
    <a href="#teams" class="nav-link">Five Teams</a>
    <a href="#connect" class="nav-link">Connect</a>
  </nav>

  <a href="#connect" class="nav-cta">Get In Touch &rarr;</a>

  <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Toggle Navigation">
    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
      <line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line>
      <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
      <line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line>
    </svg>
  </button>
</header>

<!-- Mobile Navigation Drawer -->
<div class="mobile-nav-drawer" id="mobileNavDrawer">
  <a href="#about" class="mobile-nav-link"><span>01 About</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
  <a href="#mission" class="mobile-nav-link"><span>02 Mission</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
  <a href="#leadership" class="mobile-nav-link"><span>03 Leadership</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
  <a href="#activities" class="mobile-nav-link"><span>04 Activities</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
  <a href="#gallery" class="mobile-nav-link"><span>05 Gallery</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
  <a href="#teamsTrack" class="mobile-nav-link"><span>06 Five Teams</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
  <a href="#connect" class="mobile-nav-link" style="color:var(--pri);"><span>07 Get in Touch</span> <span>&rarr;</span></a>
</div>

<!-- =======================================================================
     PART 2: HERO SECTION WITH 3D DUAL-COIN ROTATING MEDALLION
     ======================================================================= -->
<div class="hero-track" id="heroTrack">
  <section class="hero-sticky" id="hero">
    <div class="hero-cinematic-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="hero-bg-img" src="public/hero-campus-clean.jpg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
      <div class="hero-bg-overlay"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-container">
      <div class="hero-content-col">
        <div class="hero-eyebrow">ACM Sathyabama Chapter</div>
        <h1 class="hero-headline">ACM<br>SATHYABAMA</h1>
        <div class="hero-subhead">Create. Collaborate. <span>Innovate.</span></div>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          A premier student chapter dedicated to fostering technical excellence, collaborative problem-solving, hands-on innovation, and computing research across campus. Exploring the frontier of computing.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#about" class="btn-primary">Explore Our Story &rarr;</a>
          <a href="#teams" class="btn-secondary">Join The Chapter &rarr;</a>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-meta-strip">
          <div class="hero-meta-item">
            <span class="hero-meta-dot"></span>
            <span>Chartered 13 Dec 2021</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-meta-item">
            <span class="hero-meta-dot"></span>
            <span>Chennai, India</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-meta-item">
            <span class="hero-meta-dot"></span>
            <span>Dept. of CSE</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3D Tandem Medallions Stage -->
      <div class="hero-stage-visual">
        <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-chromatic-glow" id="heroChromaticGlow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <canvas class="hero-particles-canvas" id="medallionParticlesCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

        <div class="tandem-medallions-3d" id="tandemMedallions">
          <!-- 3D Laser Energy Ribbon (Background) -->
          <div class="laser-ribbon-wrap laser-ribbon-bg" id="laserRibbonBg" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" fill="none" class="laser-svg">
              <ellipse cx="300" cy="200" rx="285" ry="115" transform="rotate(18 300 200)" stroke="rgba(255, 42, 62, 0.45)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="14 10" />
              <ellipse cx="300" cy="200" rx="285" ry="115" transform="rotate(18 300 200)" stroke="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)" stroke-width="1" />
            </svg>
          </div>

          <!-- FRONT MEDALLION (Left, Foreground Tandem Perspective) -->
          <div class="medallion-coin coin-front" id="coinFront">
            <div class="coin-rim coin-rim-base" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="coin-rim coin-rim-mid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="coin-rim coin-rim-top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="coin-neon-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="coin-face">
              <div class="coin-glass-sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <img 
                class="coin-face-img" 
                src="public/acm-front-medallion.png" 
                alt="ACM at SIST Official Emblem - Front Medallion" 
                loading="eager"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- BACK MEDALLION (Right, Recessed Companion Tandem Perspective) -->
          <div class="medallion-coin coin-back" id="coinBack">
            <div class="coin-rim coin-rim-base" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="coin-rim coin-rim-mid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="coin-rim coin-rim-top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="coin-neon-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="coin-face">
              <div class="coin-glass-sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 500 500" width="100%" height="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <defs>
                  <radialGradient id="backGrad" cx="35%" cy="30%" r="70%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2a080d" />
                    <stop offset="45%" stop-color="#140205" />
                    <stop offset="85%" stop-color="#050102" />
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#000000" />
                  </radialGradient>
                  <radialGradient id="coreGlow" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ffffff" />
                    <stop offset="35%" stop-color="#ff4d5a" />
                    <stop offset="70%" stop-color="#ff2a3b" stop-opacity="0.6" />
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#80000a" stop-opacity="0" />
                  </radialGradient>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="250" cy="250" r="248" fill="url(#backGrad)" />
                <circle cx="250" cy="250" r="240" stroke="#ff2a3b" stroke-width="2.5" opacity="0.95" />
                <circle cx="250" cy="250" r="236" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.5" />
                <circle cx="250" cy="250" r="226" stroke="#ff2a3b" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 8" opacity="0.4" />
                <g transform="translate(250, 180)">
                  <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="82" ry="34" transform="rotate(-38)" stroke="#ff4d5a" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" opacity="0.92" />
                  <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="82" ry="34" transform="rotate(38)" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.2" fill="none" opacity="0.88" />
                  <ellipse cx="0" cy="0" rx="82" ry="32" transform="rotate(84)" stroke="#ff2a3b" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none" opacity="0.95" />
                  <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="22" fill="url(#coreGlow)" />
                  <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="9" fill="#ff2a3b" />
                  <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="3.5" fill="#ffffff" />
                </g>
                <text x="250" y="325" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Inter', sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="28" fill="#ffffff" letter-spacing="4">ACM SATHYABAMA</text>
                <text x="250" y="360" text-anchor="middle" font-family="'Inter', sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="12" letter-spacing="3.2">
                  <tspan fill="#ffffff">CREATE. COLLABORATE. </tspan>
                  <tspan fill="#ff2a3b">INNOVATE.</tspan>
                </text>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3D Laser Energy Ribbon (Foreground) -->
          <div class="laser-ribbon-wrap laser-ribbon-fg" id="laserRibbonFg" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" fill="none" class="laser-svg">
              <ellipse cx="300" cy="200" rx="270" ry="110" transform="rotate(-12 300 200)" stroke="url(#laserFgGrad)" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1100 400" />
              <ellipse cx="300" cy="200" rx="270" ry="110" transform="rotate(-12 300 200)" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.88" stroke-dasharray="700 500" />
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="laserFgGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                  <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#ff2a3b" />
                  <stop offset="35%" stop-color="#ff4d5a" />
                  <stop offset="50%" stop-color="#ffffff" />
                  <stop offset="70%" stop-color="#ff2a3b" />
                  <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#990f1d" />
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
            </svg>
          </div>

          <!-- Apex Starburst Lens Flare -->
          <div class="apex-lens-flare" id="apexLensFlare" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-scroll-prompt">
      <div class="mouse-pill">
        <div class="mouse-wheel"></div>
      </div>
      <span>Scroll To Explore</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- =======================================================================
     PART 3: ABOUT SECTION (Driven by curiosity)
     ======================================================================= -->
<section class="section-about" id="about">
  <div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-grid-3col">
      <div class="about-col-left">
        <div class="section-tag">Our Mission</div>
        <h2 class="editorial-headline">
          Driven by <em>curiosity.</em><br>Defined by community.
        </h2>
        <a href="#mission" class="about-cta-link">Explore Our Mission &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="about-col-center">
        <div class="about-monolith-card">
          <img src="public/acm_rock_monolith.png" class="about-monolith-img" alt="ACM Rock Monolith">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-col-right">
        <div class="about-history-tag">01 // Introduction</div>
        <p class="about-narrative">
          Founded on <strong>13 December 2021</strong>, the Sathyabama Institute ACM Student Chapter is a growing community of students passionate about computing, innovation, and technology-driven problem solving.
        </p>
        <p class="about-narrative">
          As an active chapter under the <strong>Department of Computer Science and Engineering</strong>, we bring together learners who explore new technologies, build real-world projects, and contribute to the global computing ecosystem.
        </p>
        <a href="#leadership" class="about-cta-link">Meet Our Team &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-stat-strip">
      <div class="about-stat-item">
        <span class="about-stat-label">Founded</span>
        <span class="about-stat-value">13 December 2021</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat-item">
        <span class="about-stat-label">Location</span>
        <span class="about-stat-value">Sathyabama Institute · Chennai</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stat-item">
        <span class="about-stat-label">Affiliation</span>
        <span class="about-stat-value">Dept. of Computer Science & Engineering</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =======================================================================
     PART 4: MISSION SECTION (A future shaped by innovation)
     ======================================================================= -->
<section class="section-mission" id="mission">
  <div class="mission-parallax-backdrop">
    <img src="public/campus_banner_backdrop.png" class="mission-backdrop-img" alt="Campus Backdrop">
  </div>

  <div class="mission-container">
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-intro">
        <div class="section-tag">Our Vision // 02</div>
        <h2 class="mission-headline">
          A future shaped by <em>innovation,</em><br>technical excellence,<br><em>and people.</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="mission-lead-p">
          Our vision is to inspire and empower students to become future-ready computing professionals through innovation, technical excellence, research thinking, and community-driven learning. We spark curiosity, enable collaboration, and help students discover the limitless possibilities of computing.
        </p>

        <div class="mission-objectives-list">
          <div class="mission-objective-row">
            <div class="mission-icon-circle">&lt;/&gt;</div>
            <div class="mission-row-text">
              Develop <strong>expertise</strong> in modern computing domains, software architecture, and artificial intelligence.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mission-objective-row">
            <div class="mission-icon-circle">&#9733;</div>
            <div class="mission-row-text">
              Host hands-on <strong>workshops</strong>, expert lectures, hackathons, and high-impact coding competitions.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mission-objective-row">
            <div class="mission-icon-circle">&#9881;</div>
            <div class="mission-row-text">
              Promote <strong>research thinking</strong> through papers, project development, and academic-industry mentorship.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mission-objective-row">
            <div class="mission-icon-circle">&#9829;</div>
            <div class="mission-row-text">
              Build an inclusive, collaborative <strong>tech community</strong> where every student finds a pathway to create impact.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mission-objective-row">
            <div class="mission-icon-circle">&#10148;</div>
            <div class="mission-row-text">
              Connect members with the global <strong>ACM network</strong>, professional conferences, and career opportunities.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

